[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238604\">7005E12</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection of of the external driving\nmirror.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Left door mirror</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237294\">P60</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Right door mirror</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237299\">P61</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Unscrew the screws of the driving mirror.</p><p>3. Take the driving mirror off.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018989.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the driving mirror\nis not damaged.</p><p>Dowel the driving mirror clamping it by\nthe screws.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Test the functionality of the driving mirror.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238604\">7005E12</a></p>"]]